(In this sentence you have to use an article for it to be grammatical.
"djica nu tcidu" is a tanru (a selbri construct). I think you wanted to
make "reading" (nu tcidu) an object of "want" (djica). "le" and the like
make selbri into sumti. Also, "mu'i" should be followed by a sumti, not
a sentence. The correct sentence would be:)

mi djica le nu tcidu lo lojban jufra kei
         ^^
mu'i le nu mi cilre le nu cusku bau la lojban
     ^^^^^          ^^

